      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Department of Traffic will receive applications for issuance or renewal of special identification cards, verify statements made in such applications as deemed necessary except for those dealing with physical disabilities, issue the cards or permits, and maintain the files and records of applications and issuances.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
