      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Department of Health will assess the physical condition of each new applicant in verification of disability statements made in his application, and will certify to the Department of Traffic that the disabilities meet or fail to meet Department of Health standards justifying the issuance of a special vehicle identification card.",
